    The remaining climate question is not \emph{whether} to avoid it,
    but \emph{how quickly} we limit further overshoot.}}
  \vspace{8pt}

  \begin{itemize}
    \item Proxy thermometry \textbf{must inform} international baselines
    \item Sclerosponges: gold-standard for pre-1850 tropical SST
    \item Future work: \textbf{Indo-Pacific} and Southern Ocean sponge networks
  \end{itemize}
  \vspace{6pt}

