    \item Tropical sensitivity: captures large-scale SST variability
    \item Completely \textbf{independent} of instrumental datasets
    \item Calibrated against HadCRUT5 / NOAA ERSSTv5 (1960--present)
  \end{itemize}
  \vspace{4pt}

  \colorbox{teal!20}{\parbox{0.94\linewidth}{%
    \fontsize{28}{36}\selectfont
