]{name=findings, column=3, between=row13 and row17}{%
  \fontsize{30}{40}\selectfont%
  \begin{enumerate}
    \item \textbf{1700--1790 baseline} reveals $>$1.5\,\textdegree{}C total warming,
          not the $\sim$1.2\,\textdegree{}C in standard reports
    \item IPCC's 1850--1900 reference is \textbf{not} pre-industrial;
          it already contains $\sim$0.5\,\textdegree{}C of anthropogenic signal
    \item Sclerosponge Sr/Ca provides \textbf{continuous, annually-resolved}
          SST back to 1700---no gaps, no splicing
    \item Proxy and instrumental records \textbf{agree excellently} from
          1960 onward ($r^{2} > 0.90$)
  \end{enumerate}
}

